cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "M&A Multiples Index — SMB & Lower-Middle-Market Valuation Multiples"
abstract: >-
  An open, continuously-updated index of real-world M&A valuation multiples
  (EV/EBITDA and EV/Revenue) for small-business and lower-middle-market
  companies, broken out by sub-vertical and enterprise-value bracket. Derived
  from disclosed multiples in completed M&A transactions (SEC EDGAR 8-K/S-4
  filings, fairness opinions, and verified press releases). Each published cell
  requires at least 10 disclosed deals; no estimated or imputed values.
type: dataset
authors:
